wler, 32, originally from the NSW Central Coast, was found unresponsive with multiple stab wounds in a bathtub at her home in Florida.", "large_image": "e6cw6l4BwzgUBqfT.png", "title": "Chilling 911 audio emerges of man accused of killing Aussie wife"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9TIUTL", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 51, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8768683, "raw_content": "", "author": "SilentGuardian", "created": 1786129954442, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "xcancel.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC9TIUTL.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://xcancel.com/EnesFreedom/status/2085772139869696032#m", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "He did it-the crazy bastard did it. Enes Kantor Freedom declares himself a prospect for the WNBA-let the screeching begin!", "last_comment_created": 1786129954442, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 51, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "After careful consideration and reviewing the current eligibility guidelines,I\u2019m officially declaring myself a @WNBA prospect.If simply declaring who you are is all that\u2019s required, then I meet every single requirement necessary to compete in the WNBA.My team and I have carefully examined the WNBA\u2019s eligibility criteria and governing framework surrounding self-identification and inclusion. Based on the current guidelines, I can and am officially declaring my eligibility for the upcoming WNBA draft in April 2027.I know my presence on the court will stir up strong opinions.I am definitely not here to mock, make fun of, or disrespect any community or personal choices.  I\u2019m simply asking that the current rules be applied equally to everyone \u2014 the rules that represent the very values many WNBA players and coaches have publicly advocated for.My team and I are prepared to ensure these guidelines are applied equally, consistently, and without exception, and I look forward to the #WNBA honoring its stated principles.", "large_image": "sOjEJytXQuPDQjny.png", "title": "Enes Kanter FREEDOM (@EnesFreedom)"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9SAudG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 269, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8767912, "raw_content": "", "author": "Poobah", "created": 1786097403064, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LowTechRedneck", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.patriots.win", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC9SAudG.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.patriots.win/post/wcM51rDkg1Z6.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/1JT4t0HJMPGn0wqd.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 584}], "blurhash": "UDLXMDGlx[I9LLMvwOnUtDMLRX%3xM?IXfo[", "full_resolution": [665, 875]}, "title": "Barbarians at the gate", "last_comment_created": 1786132547774, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 16, "score_up": 269, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"sta